                                Reckoning Day.
                                  Megadeth
				 Youthansia.			

Tabbed By: Mat. 18th December '94.

Note:   Acoustic bit?... What acoustic bit?  ;)

Notation:       h = Hammer;	p = Pull;	. = Palmute
		\ = Slide down;	/ = Slide up;	b = bend to note
                x = Palmute whilst muffling strings with left hand.
                tr= Trill.

Tempo approx. 120 4/4.

